GEOME LICENSE DECISION

The project owner has not selected or approved a license for this project.
No open-source license or public redistribution permission is granted by this
file. Do not publish source releases, binaries, or APT packages until the owner
has supplied an approved license and verified the applicable rights.

This is an explicit release decision record, not a software license. Local
development and validation are performed at the requesting owner's direction.

The dynamically linked dependencies have independent licenses:
- libcurl: curl license, https://curl.se/docs/copyright.html
- cJSON: MIT license, https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON/blob/master/LICENSE

Those permissive dependency licenses allow linking and redistribution subject
to their copyright and permission notices; they do not license geome itself.
No dependency source is bundled here. Redistribution of dependency binaries
must preserve their notices and satisfy their transitive dependency licenses.
Debian's system library packages carry their own copyright files.

The IP geolocation provider's service terms are separate from software
licensing. Review https://ipwhois.io/terms before deployment or distribution.
